","exbn":"তোমার ব্যাগটা চেয়ারের উপর রাখো।","d":"to place something somewhere"},{"n":140,"w":"another","p":"determiner","bn":"আরেকটা, অন্য একটা","ex":"Can I have another cup of tea?","exbn":"আমি কি আরেক কাপ চা পেতে পারি?","d":"one more"},{"n":141,"w":"become","p":"verb","bn":"হয়ে ওঠা, হওয়া","ex":"She wants to become a doctor.","exbn":"সে ডাক্তার হতে চায়।","d":"to begin to be"},{"n":142,"w":"interest","p":"noun","bn":"আগ্রহ; সুদ","ex":"I have a big interest in music.","exbn":"গানের প্রতি আমার অনেক আগ্রহ।","d":"a feeling of wanting to know more"},{"n":143,"w":"country","p":"noun","bn":"দেশ","ex":"Bangladesh is a beautiful country.","exbn":"বাংলাদেশ একটা সুন্দর দেশ।","d":"a nation with its own land and government"},{"n":144,"w":"old","p":"adjective","bn":"পুরনো; বয়স্ক","ex":"My grandfather is very old.","exbn":"আমার দাদা অনেক বয়স্ক।","d":"having lived for a long time"},{"n":145,"w":"each","p":"determiner","bn":"প্রত্যেক","ex":"Each student has a book.","exbn":"প্রত্যেক ছাত্রের একটা বই আছে।","d":"every one, taken separately"},{"n":146,"w":"school","p":"noun","bn":"স্কুল, বিদ্যালয়","ex":"My son goes to school by rickshaw.","exbn":"আমার ছেলে রিকশায় করে স্কুলে যায়।","d":"a place where children go to learn"},{"n":147,"w":"late","p":"adjective","bn":"দেরি","ex":"Sorry, I am late.","exbn":"দুঃখিত, আমার দেরি হয়ে গেছে।","d":"after the expected time"},{"n":148,"w":"high","p":"adjective","bn":"উঁচু; বেশি","ex":"The price is too high.","exbn":"দামটা অনেক বেশি।","d":"above the usual level"},{"n":149,"w":"different","p":"adjective","bn":"ভিন্ন, আলাদা","ex":"We have different ideas.","exbn":"আমাদের ভাবনা আলাদা।","d":"not the same"},{"n":150,"w":"off","p":"adverb","bn":"বন্ধ; দূরে","ex":"Please turn off the light.","exbn":"দয়া করে লাইটটা বন্ধ করে দাও।","d":"not working or switched on"},{"n":151,"w":"next","p":"adjective","bn":"পরের","ex":"See you next week.","exbn":"পরের সপ্তাহে দেখা হবে।","d":"coming straight after this one"},{"n":152,"w":"end","p":"noun","bn":"শেষ","ex":"Wait until the end of the movie.","exbn":"সিনেমার শেষ পর্যন্ত অপেক্ষা করো।","d":"the final part of something"},{"n":153,"w":"live","p":"verb","bn":"থাকা, বাস করা; বেঁচে থাকা","ex":"Where do you live?","exbn":"তুমি কোথায় থাকো?","d":"to have your home in a place"},{"n":154,"w":"why","p":"adverb","bn":"কেন","ex":"Why are you sad?","exbn":"তুমি কেন মন খারাপ করে আছো?","d":"for what reason"},{"n":155,"w":"while","p":"conjunction","bn":"যখন, এর মধ্যে","ex":"I listen to music while I cook.","exbn":"রান্না করার সময় আমি গান শুনি।","d":"during the time that"},{"n":156,"w":"world","p":"noun","bn":"পৃথিবী, বিশ্ব","ex":"He wants to travel the world.","exbn":"সে পুরো পৃথিবী ঘুরতে চায়।","d":"the earth and all its countries"},{"n":157,"w":"week","p":"noun","bn":"সপ্তাহ","ex":"I go to the gym three times a week.","exbn":"আমি সপ্তাহে তিন দিন জিমে যাই।","d":"seven days"},{"n":158,"w":"play","p":"verb","bn":"খেলা; বাজানো","ex":"The children play in the field.","exbn":"বাচ্চারা মাঠে খেলে।","d":"to do things for fun"},{"n":159,"w":"might","p":"modal verb","bn":"হয়তো","ex":"It might rain today.","exbn":"আজ হয়তো বৃষ্টি হতে পারে।","d":"used to say something is possible"},{"n":160,"w":"must","p":"modal verb","bn":"অবশ্যই করতে হবে","ex":"You must wear a helmet.","exbn":"তোমাকে অবশ্যই হেলমেট পরতে হবে।","d":"used to say something is necessary"},{"n":161,"w":"home","p":"noun","bn":"বাড়ি, বাসা","ex":"I am going home now.","exbn":"আমি এখন বাসায় যাচ্ছি।","d":"the place where you live"},{"n":162,"w":"never","p":"adverb","bn":"কখনো না","ex":"I never drink coffee at night.","exbn":"আমি রাতে কখনো কফি খাই না।","d":"not at any time"},{"n":163,"w":"include","p":"verb","bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত করা","ex":"The price includes breakfast.","exbn":"দামের মধ্যে সকালের নাস্তাও ধরা আছে।","d":"to have something as one part"},{"n":164,"w":"course","p":"noun","bn":"কোর্স; (of course) অবশ্যই","ex":"I am taking an English course.","exbn":"আমি একটা ইংরেজি কোর্স করছি।","d":"a set of lessons"},{"n":165,"w":"house","p":"noun","bn":"বাড়ি, ঘর","ex":"Their house is near the river.","exbn":"তাদের বাড়িটা নদীর কাছে।","d":"a building where people live"},{"n":166,"w":"report","p":"noun","bn":"রিপোর্ট, প্রতিবেদন","ex":"I need to finish this report today.","exbn":"আজ আমাকে এই রিপোর্টটা শেষ করতে হবে।","d":"a written document about a subject"},{"n":167,"w":"group","p":"noun","bn":"দল, গ্রুপ","ex":"We work in a small group.","exbn":"আমরা একটা ছোট দলে কাজ করি।","d":"a number of people together"},{"n":168,"w":"case","p":"noun","bn":"ঘটনা, ক্ষেত্র; (in case) যদি","ex":"In that case, I will wait.","exbn":"সেক্ষেত্রে আমি অপেক্ষা করব।","d":"a situation"},{"n":169,"w":"woman","p":"noun","bn":"নারী, মহিলা","ex":"That woman is my teacher.","exbn":"ঐ মহিলা আমার শিক্ষক।","d":"an adult female person"},{"n":170,"w":"around","p":"preposition","bn":"চারপাশে; প্রায়","ex":"There are trees around the house.","exbn":"বাড়ির চারপাশে গাছ আছে।","d":"on every side of something"},{"n":171,"w":"book","p":"noun","bn":"বই","ex":"I am reading a good book.","exbn":"আমি একটা ভালো বই পড়ছি।","d":"pages with writing, joined inside a cover"},{"n":172,"w":"family","p":"noun","bn":"পরিবার","ex":"I love my family.","exbn":"আমি আমার পরিবারকে ভালোবাসি।","d":"parents, children and relatives"},{"n":173,"w":"seem","p":"verb","bn":"মনে হওয়া","ex":"You seem tired.","exbn":"তোমাকে ক্লান্ত মনে হচ্ছে।","d":"to appear to be"},{"n":174,"w":"let","p":"verb","bn":"করতে দেওয়া","ex":"Let me help you.","exbn":"আমাকে তোমাকে সাহায্য করতে দাও।","d":"to allow someone to do something"},{"n":175,"w":"again","p":"adverb","bn":"আবার","ex":"Please say it again.","exbn":"দয়া করে আবার বলুন।","d":"one more time"},{"n":176,"w":"kind","p":"noun","bn":"ধরন; (adjective) দয়ালু","ex":"What kind of music do you like?","exbn":"তুমি কোন ধরনের গান পছন্দ করো?","d":"a type or sort"},{"n":177,"w":"keep","p":"verb","bn":"রাখা; চালিয়ে যাওয়া","ex":"Keep your phone in your pocket.","exbn":"তোমার ফোন পকেটে রাখো।","d":"to have something and not lose it"},{"n":178,"w":"hear","p":"verb","bn":"শোনা","ex":"Can you hear me?","exbn":"তুমি কি আমার কথা শুনতে পাচ্ছ?","d":"to notice sounds with your ears"},{"n":179,"w":"system","p":"noun","bn":"পদ্ধতি, ব্যবস্থা","ex":"The new system is very fast.","exbn":"নতুন ব্যবস্থাটা খুব দ্রুত।","d":"a way of organising or doing something"},{"n":180,"w":"every","p":"determiner","bn":"প্রতি, প্রত্যেক","ex":"I walk every morning.","exbn":"আমি প্রতিদিন সকালে হাঁটি।","d":"each one of a group"},{"n":181,"w":"question","p":"noun","bn":"প্রশ্ন","ex":"I have a question.","exbn":"আমার একটা প্রশ্ন আছে।","d":"something you ask"},{"n":182,"w":"during","p":"preposition","bn":"চলাকালীন, সময়ে","ex":"Don't talk during the exam.","exbn":"পরীক্ষার সময় কথা বলবে না।","d":"while something is happening"},{"n":183,"w":"always","p":"adverb","bn":"সবসময়","ex":"She is always on time.","exbn":"সে সবসময় সময়মতো আসে।","d":"at all times"},{"n":184,"w":"big","p":"adjective","bn":"বড়","ex":"They live in a big house.","exbn":"তারা একটা বড় বাড়িতে থাকে।","d":"large in size"},{"n":185,"w":"set","p":"verb","bn":"ঠিক করা, বসানো","ex":"I set an alarm for six.","exbn":"আমি ছয়টার জন্য অ্যালার্ম দিয়েছি।","d":"to make a clock or machine ready"},{"n":186,"w":"small","p":"adjective","bn":"ছোট","ex":"I have a small car.","exbn":"আমার একটা ছোট গাড়ি আছে।","d":"little in size"},{"n":187,"w":"study","p":"verb","bn":"পড়াশোনা করা","ex":"I study English every day.","exbn":"আমি প্রতিদিন ইংরেজি পড়ি।","d":"to learn about a subject"},{"n":188,"w":"follow","p":"verb","bn":"অনুসরণ করা","ex":"Follow me, please.","exbn":"দয়া করে আমার পিছে পিছে আসুন।","d":"to go after someone"},{"n":189,"w":"begin","p":"verb","bn":"শুরু করা","ex":"The meeting will begin soon.","exbn":"মিটিং শিগগিরই শুরু হবে।","d":"to start"},{"n":190,"w":"important","p":"adjective","bn":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","ex":"This is an important meeting.","exbn":"এটা একটা গুরুত্বপূর্ণ মিটিং।","d":"having great value or effect"},{"n":191,"w":"since","p":"preposition","bn":"থেকে (কোনো সময় থেকে)","ex":"I have lived here since 2020.","exbn":"আমি ২০২০ সাল থেকে এখানে থাকি।","d":"from a time in the past until now"},{"n":192,"w":"run","p":"verb","bn":"দৌড়ানো; চালানো","ex":"I run in the park every morning.","exbn":"আমি প্রতিদিন সকালে পার্কে দৌড়াই।","d":"to move fast on your feet"},{"n":193,"w":"under","p":"preposition","bn":"নিচে","ex":"The cat is under the bed.","exbn":"বিড়ালটা খাটের নিচে।","d":"below something"},{"n":194,"w":"turn","p":"verb","bn":"ঘোরানো, বাঁক নেওয়া","ex":"Turn left at the corner.","exbn":"মোড়ে গিয়ে বাঁয়ে ঘুরুন।","d":"to change direction"},{"n":195,"w":"few","p":"determiner","bn":"অল্প কয়েকটা","ex":"I have a few friends here.","exbn":"এখানে আমার অল্প কয়েকজন বন্ধু আছে।","d":"a small number of"},{"n":196,"w":"bring","p":"verb","bn":"নিয়ে আসা","ex":"Please bring some water.","exbn":"দয়া করে একটু পানি নিয়ে আসো।","d":"to carry something to a place"},{"n":197,"w":"early","p":"adjective","bn":"তাড়াতাড়ি, সকাল সকাল","ex":"I wake up early.","exbn":"আমি সকাল সকাল ঘুম থেকে উঠি।","d":"before the usual time"},{"n":198,"w":"hand","p":"noun","bn":"হাত","ex":"Raise your hand.","exbn":"তোমার হাত তোলো।","d":"the part at the end of your arm"},{"n":199,"w":"state","p":"noun","bn":"রাষ্ট্র, রাজ্য; অবস্থা","ex":"Texas is a big state.","exbn":"টেক্সাস একটা বড় রাজ্য।","d":"a part of a country with its own government"},{"n":200,"w":"move","p":"verb","bn":"নড়া, সরানো; বাসা বদলানো","ex":"We will move to a new flat.","exbn":"আমরা একটা নতুন ফ্ল্যাটে উঠব।","d":"to go to live in a new place"}]